# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_6078> (ivermectin)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_6078> "A mixture consisting of ≥ 90% 22,23-dihydroavermectin B<small><sub>1a</sub></small> (R = Me) and ≤ 10% 22,23-dihydroavermectin B<small><sub>1b</sub></small> (R = H). A semi-synthetic derivative of abamectin, it is used as a broad-spectrum antiparasite medication, particularly against worms (except tapeworms), although it is also effective against most mites and some lice.")
